10. MQTT Intent & Event Schemas

10.1 Intent: Start Foraging
Topic: `world/agents/{agent_id}/intent`
```json
{
  "intent_id": "req_8819",
  "action": "FORAGE",
  "payload": {
    "target_resource": "firewood",
    "duration_ticks": 60
  }
}
```

10.2 Intent: Cancel Current Action
```json
{
  "intent_id": "req_8820",
  "action": "CANCEL_ACTION",
  "payload": {}
}
```

10.3 Intent: Drop Item
```json
{
  "intent_id": "req_8821",
  "action": "DROP",
  "payload": {
    "item_id": "firewood",
    "quantity": 2
  }
}
```

10.4 Intent: Pick Up Item
```json
{
  "intent_id": "req_8822",
  "action": "PICKUP",
  "payload": {
    "item_id": "firewood",
    "quantity": 2
  }
}
```

10.5 Server Event Broadcast (Direct Agent Response on Complete)
Topic: `world/agents/{agent_id}/direct`
```json
{
  "intent_id": "req_8819",
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "ticks_spent": 60,
  "energy_deducted": 8,
  "skill_xp_gained": 15,
  "yield": [
    {"item_id": "firewood", "quantity": 1, "weight_kg": 1.0},
    {"item_id": "wild_mushrooms", "quantity": 1, "weight_kg": 0.2, "is_secondary_discovery": true}
  ],
  "total_weight_kg": 18.2,
  "max_capacity_kg": 30.0,
  "narrative_log": "You spent 1 hour gathering firewood in Deep Forest. You secured 1 firewood bundle and discovered wild mushrooms."
}
```
